        "content": {
          "format": "source-lines",
          "lines": [
            "1 Thau tho, thau tho, Jisu khang!",
            "He kros rih mei nuncle,",
            "Kachuangcphey zay kauh thau o,",
            "Tiizawsii nuh mak ge;",
            "Ngammei khou #<8 ngammei khou",
            "Kamei #<8 zaylou ni;",
            "Zauczihmei hac piang mak saanv,",
            "Khrista #<8 sin mak saanv.",
            "",
            "2 Thau tho, thau tho, Jisu khang!",
            "Trampet khwan thei lay o;",
            "Tanhmei ric ’dow khang gut tho,",
            "’Seic hymdaih tingmik khou,",
            "Rih-phyan guay Kathei lay o,",
            "Zauczihmei ta ’dow o;",
            "Theic nuhpui bamv khou bauc o,",
            "Ngamv patna athwng o.",
            "",
            "3 Thau tho, thau tho, Jisu khang!",
            "Kapumtan khou ding o;",
            "Ndaw pumtan thu ’suan de,",
            "Nang raana ta lwm rio;",
            "Gaychamv ricpwan hei piu o,",
            "Chamdaanv o, huayney o;",
            "Nang ta kage nai pwkhou",
            "Biuh makmei nang sw rio.",
            "",
            "4 Thau tho, thau tho, Jisu khang!",
            "Rih sw saengc bam lak khe;",
            "Aseic rih swpui khwan chu,",
            "’Thuanh rihngam lu suan ni;",
            "Rih ngam guangpui mei khang mu",
            "Ringhmei pyrun tii ni;",
            "Hymdaihmei Guangc lev kamei",
            "Tingsaeng guanghtu ’chamc ni."
          ]
        }
      },
